{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "028soi_403_2_4_028_03_09_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:a94698727d9090bc15fd9cd55c81807ba719e5ff78c163117adb1500ae1a022d",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:028soi_403_2_4_028_03_09_a:2_4_028_03_09_a:cmd-000007:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c178f7b8e6ce6a17a4732f72a1a16260bc7cf91bb1790f8458ead7b99982887f",
      "text": "辛苦了。刚才把事情办妥了，\n我现在就前往事务所。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:028soi_403_2_4_028_03_09_a:2_4_028_03_09_a:cmd-000009:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d99937265a736a767d7fd1406bfa40e8ed5f24a7e38bb8d6c996846aaab0c69b",
      "text": "说起来，近期红井先生、樱庭先生，\n还有眉见先生有来这边的预定吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:028soi_403_2_4_028_03_09_a:2_4_028_03_09_a:cmd-000011:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:75e35b9744c8a46795abf260082ea737fcaf1dc2a6db2b50e5c7069a6b44d6fb",
      "text": "为了感谢前些天拍摄时承蒙的关照，\n我准备了慰劳品。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:028soi_403_2_4_028_03_09_a:2_4_028_03_09_a:cmd-000013:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:030e2ebd576b6bca982390b720437019cc28bdfe79c9e25e71807119d9162544",
      "text": "预定今天晚些时候会来",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:028soi_403_2_4_028_03_09_a:2_4_028_03_09_a:cmd-000016:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fe918402047e7f3d807c73a7ef7ef899803a9f4d00949bfb6f5bba5aa7a73749",
      "text": "这样啊。赶得正巧呢。\n看来能亲手交出去了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:028soi_403_2_4_028_03_09_a:2_4_028_03_09_a:cmd-000018:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:34116b94776881e52b3bf82272d46f10f2d7a8d518f0313ebf553a6084b9b648",
      "text": "里面也有制作人的份，\n方便的话还请尝尝。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:028soi_403_2_4_028_03_09_a:2_4_028_03_09_a:cmd-000020:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3cc7cd4aa4d820e999418444a7fdff540743b68a66b856aaa09d2634697d2f54",
      "text": "前些天的工作，也许是因为主题是\n为职场新人加油吧，",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:028soi_403_2_4_028_03_09_a:2_4_028_03_09_a:cmd-000022:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b0eb061cc3493147f818707f9167688ea755b1e9e3e072065f4c0c305ddfba27",
      "text": "让我再次切身体会到了能够与同一职场的伙伴\n齐心协力是多么可贵。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:028soi_403_2_4_028_03_09_a:2_4_028_03_09_a:cmd-000024:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8cecbae93d938850b467c3ec27f1184a076354b1b8c710dbe38fcf7825f6760d",
      "text": "试用文具的时候，水嶋先生和\n卷绪先生也帮了忙，",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:028soi_403_2_4_028_03_09_a:2_4_028_03_09_a:cmd-000026:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:92b5bbceb87770d37187b9c20f41bf36799b0932085af87d3d9a0317b9fbfcb1",
      "text": "和红井先生他们，也为了拍摄\n进行了很好的交流商讨。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:028soi_403_2_4_028_03_09_a:2_4_028_03_09_a:cmd-000028:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2c0921953a473f92aecacf037a0a7b5b8f983ad8c51384c06d74e0f77a43e83a",
      "text": "我想大家也都很感激",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:028soi_403_2_4_028_03_09_a:2_4_028_03_09_a:cmd-000029:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fa8d67816aee76bedb7200aa2cd7269e2e267e15b911736ac11a0e0bdfda1675",
      "text": "多亏如此，做出了\n很棒的海报呢",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:028soi_403_2_4_028_03_09_a:2_4_028_03_09_a:cmd-000032:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a23988c6a758e0bc935ba80f6dc66fdb638b0f788e64c6bffeb2e5f4e87a73bc",
      "text": "能听到您这么说，我也很高兴。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:028soi_403_2_4_028_03_09_a:2_4_028_03_09_a:cmd-000037:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:53de4f4467fb8f403ce500df019a43f6530955fbe2b0d0f9f9e6f7d06d80039e",
      "text": "是的。我自己看到那张海报，\n总觉得都会挺直背脊呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:028soi_403_2_4_028_03_09_a:2_4_028_03_09_a:cmd-000041:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5348a24b3547fc1202a43ecec902df86ce498890f583707918116073f56c6428",
      "text": "像这样回想起来，就让人想早点和大家说说话呢。\n那么稍后见。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
